       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DIGI-HOLO.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DIGI-HOLO-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CARRIER-DEMOD-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HEIGHT-RESOL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNWRAPPING-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DHM-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DHM-SEAL-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DIGI-HOLO-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PDH-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PDH-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DEMOD-AND-HEIGHT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-UNWRAP-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PDH-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DEMOD-AND-HEIGHT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CARRIER-DEMOD-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HEIGHT-RESOL-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-UNWRAP-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNWRAPPING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DHM-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PDH-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CARRIER-DEMOD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HEIGHT-RESOL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-UNWRAPPING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DHM-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DHM-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PDH-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PDH-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PDH-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PDH-CODE.
